                                            "A permit to operate a machine on a construction site."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d81c0a27-2e1b-352c-8ddd-7e2f6c6a1c34",
                                        "entry_id": "93271122-f14f-3b82-9bb8-6f0c72713992",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small document that acts as proof of something, often thereby granting the holder some ability.",
                                            "A certificate or token of a share in a lottery or other scheme for distributing money, goods, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a6d3e2f-f215-4054-af37-df7bade70520",
                                                "sense_id": "d81c0a27-2e1b-352c-8ddd-7e2f6c6a1c34",
                                                "text": "lottery ticket   raffle ticket"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "afe31b6c-6d93-4c3d-b1da-a895ea1993f1",
                                                "sense_id": "d81c0a27-2e1b-352c-8ddd-7e2f6c6a1c34",
                                                "text": "If I'd used my usual numbers, it would've been a winning ticket! Unlucky!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f4fe07c5-5e1a-3fa2-baba-3ad9960ca3f2",
                                        "entry_id": "93271122-f14f-3b82-9bb8-6f0c72713992",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small document that acts as proof of something, often thereby granting the holder some ability.",
                                            "A certificate of qualification as a ship's master, pilot, or other crew member."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f26d4a6d-dba9-47b5-9090-20182285758b",
                                                "sense_id": "f4fe07c5-5e1a-3fa2-baba-3ad9960ca3f2",
                                                "text": "The variety of the demands of the railways for staff is almost endless. They require men with master's tickets as dock masters and to command their steamships."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "785f7276-fd5f-3ef6-809d-4c5bb5bec046",
                                        "entry_id": "93271122-f14f-3b82-9bb8-6f0c72713992",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small document that acts as proof of something, often thereby granting the holder some ability.",
                                            "A solution to a problem; something that is needed in order to do something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33346f34-539a-4446-99ff-ffd21b40c8a2",
                                                "sense_id": "785f7276-fd5f-3ef6-809d-4c5bb5bec046",
                                                "text": "That's the ticket."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56833e08-6b95-475b-b18f-8960861ea66c",
                                                "sense_id": "785f7276-fd5f-3ef6-809d-4c5bb5bec046",
                                                "text": "I saw my first bike as my ticket to freedom."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3bca4116-f958-4aee-8f87-80a005aa3e10",
                                                "sense_id": "785f7276-fd5f-3ef6-809d-4c5bb5bec046",
                                                "text": "\"Here's the ticket. This hole's big enough for Jim to get through if we wrench off the board.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23b70526-a325-38a0-9579-f3666ea029b7",
                                        "entry_id": "93271122-f14f-3b82-9bb8-6f0c72713992",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A citation for a traffic violation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3327db0e-6563-3ae2-bbe9-7aa78197a707",
                                        "entry_id": "93271122-f14f-3b82-9bb8-6f0c72713992",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A service request, used to track complaints or requests that an issue be handled."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88fa63cc-de59-4d27-9a59-de5ecbc16dba",
                                                "sense_id": "3327db0e-6563-3ae2-bbe9-7aa78197a707",
                                                "text": "\"Yeah.\" It was him, alright; if the world's weariest pair of workboots hadn't tipped her off, his world-weary voice certainly would have. \"Where were you?\"\n\"My quarters. We've got a full ticket set today, and techs work best without oversight.\" Neither of these things was untrue, though the curation was more than a little dishonest.\n\"Maybe yours do.\" Nascimbeni rolled out, back flat against a neon orange creeper, and sat up with an audible wince. \"Mine fuck the dog.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71500563-aa51-3f27-aa8a-c73bf363dd5d",
                                        "entry_id": "93271122-f14f-3b82-9bb8-6f0c72713992",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A list of candidates for an election, or a particular theme to a candidate's manifesto."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d4325a6-3c2a-4fbd-826b-d231880d50d6",
                                                "sense_id": "71500563-aa51-3f27-aa8a-c73bf363dd5d",
                                                "text": "Joe has joined the party's ticket for the county elections."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00970050-d79b-4d04-a00d-4fb0696c7029",
                                                "sense_id": "71500563-aa51-3f27-aa8a-c73bf363dd5d",
                                                "text": "Joe will be running on an anti-crime ticket."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ae49c94-c981-4d57-9dfd-eda4e40e084c",
                                                "sense_id": "71500563-aa51-3f27-aa8a-c73bf363dd5d",
                                                "text": "Candidates like Ocasio-Cortez and Sanders are no longer too precious to run on the Democratic ticket, though the proposals they suggest are so ambitious — like Medicare for All, a Green New Deal, and free public college — that they don’t feel like compromises at all."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d670e8d-e602-4445-bac4-cc4ca7c002e5",
                                                "sense_id": "71500563-aa51-3f27-aa8a-c73bf363dd5d",
                                                "text": "Harris’s victory comes 55 years after the Voting Rights Act abolished laws that disenfranchised Black Americans, 36 years after the first woman ran on a presidential ticket and four years after Democrats were devastated by the defeat of Hillary Clinton"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b724a37-b0f4-3025-ba75-9fa2e42b4720",
                                        "entry_id": "93271122-f14f-3b82-9bb8-6f0c72713992",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small note or notice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de0fe202-8a7c-469e-8cad-46dee7ae25ae",
                                                "sense_id": "7b724a37-b0f4-3025-ba75-9fa2e42b4720",
                                                "text": "He constantly read his lectures twice a week for above forty years, giving notice of the time to his auditors in a ticket on the school doors."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "879332a3-a3a1-3155-ac2f-36aedc274773",
                                        "entry_id": "93271122-f14f-3b82-9bb8-6f0c72713992",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tradesman's bill or account (hence the phrase on ticket and eventually on tick)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef38fa5a-87f6-4b9e-92d7-10f9bee4f906",
                                                "sense_id": "879332a3-a3a1-3155-ac2f-36aedc274773",
                                                "text": "Your courtier is mad to take up silks and velvets / On ticket for his mistress."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d79ede5e-083a-3912-9934-bc4f0b40e0d9",
                                        "entry_id": "93271122-f14f-3b82-9bb8-6f0c72713992",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A label affixed to goods to show their price or description."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c942bf3-af0b-3d12-90fa-298e2f2380f1",
                                        "entry_id": "93271122-f14f-3b82-9bb8-6f0c72713992",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A visiting card."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6608d19e-b934-481e-8c51-50341a8c30f1",
                                                "sense_id": "5c942bf3-af0b-3d12-90fa-298e2f2380f1",
                                                "text": "I asked for a card, please, and she was quite put about, and said that she didn't require tickets to get in where she visited."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e870fb47-d46b-4963-b664-8e51b911085b",
                                                "sense_id": "5c942bf3-af0b-3d12-90fa-298e2f2380f1",
                                                "text": "\"Mr. Gibbs come in just now,\" said Mrs. Blewett, \"and left his ticket over the chimley. There 'tis. I haven't touched it.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dbb5f275-6094-3917-aff5-8e6397c74b47",
                                        "entry_id": "93271122-f14f-3b82-9bb8-6f0c72713992",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A warrant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae84fc07-c7ec-41ad-adb2-988dcd3a10ea",
                                                "sense_id": "dbb5f275-6094-3917-aff5-8e6397c74b47",
                                                "text": "[…] I need a ticket, Bobby.” Agnor knew a ticket meant a search warrant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
